<title>UK: European physical metal trades - July 23.</title>
<headline>European physical metal trades - July 23.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trades reported as follows. All</p>
<p>prices in $/tonne and premium to LME unless stated.</p>
<p>JULY 22</p>
<p>CIS unpaid zinc, cif Rotterdam, $20.</p>
<p>Western duty unpaid aluminium, cif Rotterdam, $45, $50.</p>
<p>Chinese tin, cif Rotterdam, $25.</p>
<p>JULY 21</p>
<p>Western aluminium duty-unpaid, cif Rotterdam, $55.</p>
<p>JULY 18</p>
<p>Antimony, cif Rotterdam, $2,020, $1,980 (outright).</p>
<p>JULY 17</p>
<p>Cadmium 99.95 percent, $0.56/lb (outright).</p>
<p>Russian cobalt, $20.00/lb, $20.30/lb (outright).</p>
<p>Ferro-vanadium, Germany, $19.55/kg (outright).</p>
</text>
